      points: ["Heading with club name and year ended 31 December 2026 (1)", "Subscriptions income $14,450 (1)", "Profit on dance $850 shown net (1)", "Rent $3,300 after prepayment (1)", "Coach fees $3,000 including the accrual (1)", "Depreciation $1,600 included and new oars excluded (1)", "Total expenditure $10,230 (1)", "Surplus $5,070 correctly labelled (1)"],
